[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?1049h\u001b[22;0;0t\u001b[1;30r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4l\u001b[?7h\u001b[?1h\u001b="]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[18d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[J\u001b[5dYou wake and see blood.\r\u001b[7dThere's blood everywhere. So much blood, that at first you don't realise there's a figure behind the\u001b[8;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "blood. It's alive, just; there's a face, twisted with pain, and more blood that bubbles from its\r\u001b[9dmouth as it breathes, and a hand that spasms as it tries to paw at the thing projecting from where a\u001b[10;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "chest should be. The eyes gaze into yours. There is still life and desperation there, but it it\r\u001b[11d"]
[0.000, "o", "knows that it is quickly running out.\r\u001b[13d"]
[0.000, "o", "You want to help. You reach out --- and that is when you realise that you are looking into the\r\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "inside of the reflective cockpit canopy, and that the face you can see is yours.\r\u001b[17d"]
[0.000, "o", "Please press SPACE to continue.\r\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
[2.506, "o", "\u001b[14d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[J\u001b[H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m Cocoon                                                                                             \u001b[2;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mChanges\r\u001b[3d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mAn Interactive Fiction by David Given\r\u001b[4dRelease 8 / Serial number 120930 / Inform 7 build 6G60 (I6/v6.32 lib 6/12N) S\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[6dYou wake.\r\u001b[7d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[8d"]
[0.000, "o", "Something's different.\u001b[K\r\u001b[9d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[10d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mCocoon\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m\u001b[K\r\u001b[11dYou are immersed in a warm, comfort"]
[0.000, "o", "ing heap of something soft. It envelops you like an old blanket.\r\u001b[13d>\u001b[K"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
