[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou are immersed in a warm, comforting heap of something soft. It envelops you like an old blanket.\r\u001b[17d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
