[0.106, "o", "\u001b7\u001b[2;17r\u001b8\r\n\u001b[1;30r\u001b[1;2H"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mForest Cathedral\r\u001b[17d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mYou fight your way free of the cottony stuff. Dim light blinds you for a moment.\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mForest Cathedral\r\u001b[20d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[40mThe trees here are huge: massive columnar towers rising out of the soft green turf to support the\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "dense leaf canopy above. Golden rays angle down between the trees, filling the vast space with dim\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "light, and reflecting off the river that runs down the east side. The air seems permeated with\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "peacefulness.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "Large green cocoons are attached to the bases of some of the trees.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "You climb out of the pile of fluff to find it's heaped on a low, leafy dais. As you step off, the\r\u001b[28d"]
[0.000, "o", "dais silently folds closed behind you to become one of the cocoons.\r\u001b[30d>\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[39;49m\u001b[37m\u001b[40m"]
